# Kavis — firmware and graphics drivers
#
# Prompt 16: "Without these, Wi-Fi or the graphics card may not work
# after installation and the user is left without internet — hence the
# exception to the 'small ISO' target." (~200 MB)
#
# Proprietary Nvidia/AMD drivers DO NOT GO HERE — installed later from
# Settings > Additional drivers.

firmware-linux
firmware-linux-nonfree
firmware-iwlwifi
firmware-realtek
firmware-atheros
firmware-misc-nonfree

# Audio hardware on modern Intel/AMD laptops does not work without this.
# Critical for the boot music (prompt 5).
firmware-sof-signed

# Mesa — open source 3D/2D acceleration
libgl1-mesa-dri
libglx-mesa0
mesa-va-drivers
